      "text": "\u00a7 2. By no later than February 19, 2026, the Department of Social Services and the Department of Homeless Services, in consultation with the Law Department, shall develop and submit to the Mayor a plan to phase out the continued use of facilities that have been operated in reliance on the suspensions and modifications of laws and rules.",
